1
00:00:06,400 --> 00:00:07,760
Let me see what this mechanical beast

2
00:00:07,760 --> 00:00:10,160
that fuses Yang arts and life energy can do.

3
00:00:21,680 --> 00:00:24,520
As expected, the Mohist mechanical beast has no core.

4
00:00:24,520 --> 00:00:26,920
It pauses when the life energy circulates.

5
00:00:27,120 --> 00:00:28,120
This is the place.

6
00:00:46,960 --> 00:00:47,960
Just wait and see.

7
00:00:53,960 --> 00:00:54,400
It has the same aura

8
00:00:54,400 --> 00:00:55,960
as the Mohist ruins

9
00:00:55,960 --> 00:00:58,320
in the Sushi Ancient Architecture Museum.

10
00:00:58,320 --> 00:00:59,360
You mean

11
00:00:59,760 --> 00:01:01,820
there was a blood sacrifice here too?

12
00:01:20,120 --> 00:01:21,050
Senior Brother.

13
00:01:21,080 --> 00:01:21,940
This is a ghost.

14
00:01:22,520 --> 00:01:24,560
It's a lingering memory of obsession.

15
00:01:24,560 --> 00:01:25,490
It has no malice.

16
00:01:26,000 --> 00:01:27,930
Let's hear what he has to say first.

17
00:01:31,720 --> 00:01:35,200
I am the Commander of the Engineer Battalion of the 7th Mixed Brigade of the Old Dynasty,

18
00:01:35,200 --> 00:01:36,280
Zhao Tieshan.

19
00:01:38,600 --> 00:01:40,729
In the 17th year of the Nine Dynasties,

20
00:01:40,759 --> 00:01:42,890
the Mohists gave us a large sum of money

21
00:01:42,920 --> 00:01:44,080
to build

22
00:01:44,280 --> 00:01:45,680
an underground project.

23
00:01:50,160 --> 00:01:52,020
After the project was completed,

24
00:01:53,240 --> 00:01:55,160
they drugged our food.

25
00:01:59,800 --> 00:02:01,280
When we woke up again,

26
00:02:01,680 --> 00:02:04,360
everyone was tied to wooden stakes.

27
00:02:07,360 --> 00:02:08,680
Every 12 years,

28
00:02:09,000 --> 00:02:11,720
they need to sacrifice a group of young people.

29
00:02:19,560 --> 00:02:22,200
That old monster of the Mohists, Mo Wuhen,

30
00:02:22,200 --> 00:02:23,720
is still alive.

31
00:02:24,160 --> 00:02:27,000
Please avenge us.

32
00:02:29,079 --> 00:02:31,540
Their families might have waited a lifetime

33
00:02:31,720 --> 00:02:33,579
without knowing where they died.

34
00:02:35,560 --> 00:02:37,690
The Mohists must pay with their lives.

35
00:02:39,640 --> 00:02:41,700
The teacher's notes are indeed here.

36
00:02:42,600 --> 00:02:44,120
These are all evidence of their crimes.

37
00:02:44,120 --> 00:02:47,200
Master said the Mohists' research on the unity of Yin and Yang in Yanshi

38
00:02:47,200 --> 00:02:48,520
can achieve immortality.

39
00:02:48,520 --> 00:02:49,720
As long as Mo Wuhen is alive,

40
00:02:49,720 --> 00:02:51,440
the Mohists will not stop the blood sacrifices.

41
00:02:51,440 --> 00:02:54,360
This year is the time for the next irrigation.

42
00:02:58,360 --> 00:03:00,080
The Eight Trigrams are only missing the Li Trigram.

43
00:03:00,080 --> 00:03:02,880
We can see the location of the Mohists' main array.

44
00:03:04,160 --> 00:03:05,880
Under the Zhenwu Temple in the capital.

45
00:03:05,880 --> 00:03:07,320
Master is very likely there.

46
00:03:07,320 --> 00:03:08,760
Let's set off immediately.

47
00:03:08,760 --> 00:03:09,800
When Kan and Li intersect,

48
00:03:09,800 --> 00:03:11,360
the Eight Trigrams will open by themselves.

49
00:03:11,360 --> 00:03:11,960
Qinghe,

50
00:03:12,320 --> 00:03:14,780
I'll wait for you in the underground palace.

51
00:03:21,600 --> 00:03:22,460
Sister Wanwan,

52
00:03:22,560 --> 00:03:23,820
we got the Gen Trigram.

53
00:03:24,320 --> 00:03:25,600
Are you all unhurt?

54
00:03:29,040 --> 00:03:30,120
We're all fine.

55
00:03:30,400 --> 00:03:31,960
We also know the final location.

56
00:03:31,960 --> 00:03:33,090
It's in the capital.

57
00:03:33,960 --> 00:03:36,020
Then I'll wait for you in the capital.

58
00:03:41,160 --> 00:03:43,360
When someone heard that Sister Wanwan was waiting in the capital,

59
00:03:43,360 --> 00:03:44,360
he made the post carriage

60
00:03:44,360 --> 00:03:46,440
travel day and night without stopping.

61
00:03:46,440 --> 00:03:47,960
I'm falling apart.

62
00:03:52,200 --> 00:03:53,930
Sister Wanwan is the best to me.

63
00:03:54,000 --> 00:03:54,800
You're back.

64
00:03:58,840 --> 00:03:59,560
You're back.

65
00:03:59,560 --> 00:04:00,720
Eat something first.

66
00:04:00,720 --> 00:04:02,650
You haven't rested well on the way.

67
00:04:08,160 --> 00:04:09,200
Wanwan's setup

68
00:04:09,360 --> 00:04:11,040
is even better than the Tang family's kitchen.

69
00:04:11,040 --> 00:04:13,300
She's just afraid Qinghe will go hungry.

70
00:04:20,560 --> 00:04:22,320
The Drum Tower is undergoing maintenance on its pulse network.

71
00:04:22,320 --> 00:04:23,960
We can't go up there recently.

72
00:04:23,960 --> 00:04:26,560
Every road and bay in the capital has its position.

73
00:04:26,560 --> 00:04:27,960
The Drum Tower is located at the wealth position

74
00:04:27,960 --> 00:04:29,220
to gather popularity.

75
00:04:29,360 --> 00:04:31,960
It's also responsible for dispatching the night bell and cloud beams.

76
00:04:31,960 --> 00:04:33,360
When I was sorting out the Lu family's letters,

77
00:04:33,360 --> 00:04:35,400
I found a sentence written by Mo Wenshan:

78
00:04:35,400 --> 00:04:39,200
'Xuanchen and I climbed the Drum Tower together when we were young.'

79
00:04:43,159 --> 00:04:45,440
Master Xuanchen and Mo Wenshan

80
00:04:47,000 --> 00:04:50,000
probably walked this street when they were young too.

81
00:04:50,680 --> 00:04:51,560
Back then,

82
00:04:52,840 --> 00:04:55,840
they must have really treated each other as brothers.

83
00:04:55,840 --> 00:04:57,100
When we rescue Master,

84
00:04:57,360 --> 00:05:00,160
let's accompany him to climb the Drum Tower again.

85
00:05:09,720 --> 00:05:10,520
Okay.

86
00:05:12,000 --> 00:05:14,660
Xuanchen sealed it here before he disappeared.

87
00:05:14,760 --> 00:05:17,400
Before the old abbot passed away, he asked someone to pass a message,

88
00:05:17,400 --> 00:05:19,400
saying someone would come to get it.

89
00:05:21,840 --> 00:05:23,040
Collect the Eight Trigrams copper coins

90
00:05:23,040 --> 00:05:24,040
to open the underground palace.

91
00:05:24,040 --> 00:05:25,720
The Taiji Pillar in the central palace is the core of the formation.

92
00:05:25,720 --> 00:05:27,200
The prisoner is locked at the top of the pillar.

93
00:05:27,200 --> 00:05:29,280
The Twelve Earthly Branches Pillars surround the four directions.

94
00:05:29,280 --> 00:05:32,440
To break the formation, you must destroy the 12 nodes in sequence within three breaths.

95
00:05:32,440 --> 00:05:33,560
If the sequence is wrong,

96
00:05:33,560 --> 00:05:35,080
everyone will be trapped in the formation

97
00:05:35,080 --> 00:05:36,520
and become Mo Wuhen's sacrifice.

98
00:05:36,520 --> 00:05:37,640
The Kan and Li trigrams

99
00:05:37,640 --> 00:05:38,800
are the final keys.

100
00:05:39,120 --> 00:05:40,640
Master is imprisoned at the Taiji Pillar.

101
00:05:40,640 --> 00:05:41,960
Is everyone ready?

102
00:05:52,720 --> 00:05:53,720
Behave yourself.

103
00:06:01,440 --> 00:06:02,520
Old Zhou and I

104
00:06:02,680 --> 00:06:04,400
will follow the structure of the Twelve Earthly Branches Formation

105
00:06:04,400 --> 00:06:06,460
to lay down the defensive ink powder.

106
00:06:16,800 --> 00:06:17,440
Kan one,

107
00:06:17,520 --> 00:06:18,160
Kun two,

108
00:06:18,320 --> 00:06:18,980
Zhen three,

109
00:06:19,080 --> 00:06:19,760
Xun four,

110
00:06:20,240 --> 00:06:20,900
Zhong five,

111
00:06:21,400 --> 00:06:21,960
Qian six,

112
00:06:22,200 --> 00:06:24,280
Dui seven, Gen eight, Li nine.

113
00:06:27,560 --> 00:06:28,640
I'll go down with you.

114
00:06:28,640 --> 00:06:29,760
The space below is complex.

115
00:06:29,760 --> 00:06:31,080
I can replenish the ink lines.

116
00:06:31,080 --> 00:06:32,640
Narrow places are more suitable for the Tang family's repeating crossbow.

117
00:06:32,640 --> 00:06:33,480
I'll bring up the rear.

118
00:06:33,480 --> 00:06:33,960
Okay.

119
00:06:34,640 --> 00:06:37,040
Everyone stay where you can see each other.

120
00:06:46,640 --> 00:06:48,100
They've been watching us.

121
00:06:51,840 --> 00:06:53,840
Triggered by breathing and body temperature.

122
00:06:53,840 --> 00:06:55,100
Don't touch the walls.

123
00:07:35,920 --> 00:07:38,040
The Kan and Li trigrams must be inserted at the same time.

124
00:07:38,040 --> 00:07:38,560
Right.

125
00:07:39,040 --> 00:07:40,600
The lock core has hundreds of mortise and tenon joints.

126
00:07:40,600 --> 00:07:41,840
Only when both sides are in place at the same time

127
00:07:41,840 --> 00:07:42,840
will it unlock layer by layer.
